WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:03.690
As we are getting ready to close
this year out, man, I just want

2
00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:06.730
to say thank you. Thank you.

3
00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:11.930
Thank you for the opportunity
that you give me to invest in you.

4
00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:16.970
The opportunity that you give
me to take these concepts

5
00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.790
and ideas

6
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:24.570
and put them together and
just enjoy the time that I get

7
00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:28.730
with God so that I can
share that with you.

8
00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.810
It is so special
and so meaningful.

9
00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:34.580
So even though I may not know you,
even though I may not spend

10
00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:38.340
time with you. I do get to spend
time with you right here, right

11
00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:40.580
now. And that's so special to me.

12
00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:43.540
So I just wanted to say thank you.

13
00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:47.780
And as we close out this year,
I want to just talk to you about

14
00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:49.620
the word content.

15
00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:52.950
What does it mean to be content?

16
00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.150
You know, we all want things.

17
00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:59.030
I want things. I'm sure
that you want things.

18
00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:01.030
There are things that we want.

19
00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:05.830
And yet somehow,
in this spiritual life,

20
00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:10.470
part of what God allows
us to develop is a feeling

21
00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:12.150
of contentment.

22
00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:15.210
Paul says it, right?

23
00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:18.410
I've learned to be content
no matter the circumstances.

24
00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:21.690
That means whether I have a lot,
whether I have a little, it

25
00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:25.770
doesn't matter. I've
learned to be content.

26
00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:27.770
And that's what I want for you.

27
00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:32.470
I want you to develop
that spiritual strength

28
00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:38.010
of contentment. What I don't
want you to do, though, is allow

29
00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:42.710
that to become a
spirit of complacency.

30
00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:48.120
And it's so easy to
move from one to the

31
00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:50.440
other, to be content.

32
00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:54.280
All of a sudden, now we become
comfortable and now we're

33
00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:56.360
comfortable. Oh, I don't
really know about that.

34
00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:59.960
I don't really, just kind of stay
in my comfort zone and now I'm

35
00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:01.300
complacent.

36
00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:04.180
Now all of a sudden
I missed the point

37
00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:06.350
of developing contentment.

38
00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:11.080
God wasn't helping you develop
spiritual contentment so that you

39
00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:15.320
could be complacent and never
do anything powerful for the

40
00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:16.590
kingdom of God.

41
00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:21.240
God's developing the spirit of
contentment in you so that no

42
00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:26.280
matter the circumstances,
your faith and your hope

43
00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:30.190
will be the light of
Christ to this world.

44
00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:33.850
Heavenly Father, Lord,
just so grateful for you.

45
00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:36.170
God, we're just leaning in.

46
00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:37.610
It's the end of the year, Lord.

47
00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:39.850
It's going to be the
beginning of a new year.

48
00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:41.690
And we're just open.

49
00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:44.090
God, we're open to what
you have for us, Lord.

50
00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:47.130
And we're learning to be content.

51
00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:51.050
And whatever we have,
Lord, we just say yes.

52
00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.250
We're learning to be content.

53
00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:56.490
God, we just don't want to allow
that to become comfort and then

54
00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:59.410
complacency. And so, Lord,

55
00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:04.740
we're grateful that by
design, the things that

56
00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:09.620
are new will continue to keep
us out of our comfort zone

57
00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:12.180
so that our contentment
can only be found in you.

58
00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.134
In Jesus' name, amen.

